{
  "name": "Rendley — Catalogue Video at Scale",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Catalogue Video at Scale\n\nRuns on a schedule. Reads product rows from a Google Sheet and, for each row, **POSTs `/v1/export` with an inline project JSON** (no saved project needed). It polls each export job, downloads the MP4, copies it to your storage, and writes the result back to the sheet.\n\n**Why raw HTTP for export?** Inline-project export isn't exposed on the community node's Export operation, so this template calls `POST https://api.rendley.com/v1/export` directly with a `Bearer` header. Build the `project` JSON from each row.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "17000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "About",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -260,
        80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Credits\nExport requires an **active Rendley subscription** and consumes **credits per render** — roughly **~10–30 credits** per short catalogue clip at 1080p. Multiply by your row count and check `POST /v1/export/cost` before a big batch.",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 320,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "17000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Plan and cost",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        200,
        80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Links expire — copy every file!\nRendley **export URLs expire after ~4 hours** and **presigned media URLs after ~3 hours**. Each row's MP4 is downloaded and re-uploaded to your own Google Drive before the sheet is updated, so nothing is lost when the link expires.",
        "height": 190,
        "width": 360,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "17000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "Expiry",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -260,
        900
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Why poll here?\nRendley has no outbound webhooks, so a workflow follows a job by polling. This batch flow polls with **Wait → Get Job → IF** instead so each sheet row stays a single linear branch inside the loop. Tune the Wait duration to your render length.",
        "height": 180,
        "width": 340,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "17000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "name": "Why poll",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        560,
        900
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "hours",
              "hoursInterval": 6
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "17000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000010",
      "name": "Schedule",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        -200,
        460
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "Products"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "17000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000011",
      "name": "Read Product Rows",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        20,
        460
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Google Sheets account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "17000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000012",
      "name": "Loop Over Rows",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitInBatches",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        240,
        460
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Build one inline Rendley project per catalogue row.\n// Replace this skeleton with your real project JSON — see the Rendley\n// timeline schema. This example just carries the row's media + title.\nconst row = $input.item.json;\nconst project = {\n  name: row.title || 'Catalogue item',\n  // e.g. layers/clips built from row.media_url, row.title, row.price, row.cta ...\n  // media: [{ url: row.media_url }],\n};\nreturn {\n  json: {\n    title: row.title || 'item',\n    export_body: {\n      project,\n      settings: { codec: 'h264', target_resolution: '1080p', quality: 'high' },\n    },\n  },\n};"
      },
      "id": "17000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000013",
      "name": "Build Export Body",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        240,
        720
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.rendley.com/v1/export",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "Bearer YOUR_RENDLEY_API_KEY"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify($json.export_body) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "17000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000014",
      "name": "POST /v1/export",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        460,
        720
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "j1",
              "name": "job_id",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.data?.job_id || $json.job_id }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "j2",
              "name": "title",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $('Build Export Body').item.json.title }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "17000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000015",
      "name": "Track Job",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        680,
        720
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "amount": 45,
        "unit": "seconds"
      },
      "id": "17000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000016",
      "name": "Wait",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        900,
        720
      ],
      "webhookId": "catalogue-export-wait"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "export",
        "operation": "getJob",
        "jobId": "={{ $('Track Job').item.json.job_id }}"
      },
      "id": "17000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000017",
      "name": "Get Export Job",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-rendley.rendley",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1120,
        720
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "rendleyApi": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Rendley API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "c1",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.status }}",
              "rightValue": "completed",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "17000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000018",
      "name": "Export Done?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1340,
        720
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "={{ $json.result?.storage_url || $json.video_url }}",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "responseFormat": "file"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "17000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000019",
      "name": "Download MP4",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1560,
        640
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "upload",
        "name": "={{ ($('Track Job').item.json.title || 'catalogue').replace(/[^a-zA-Z0-9-_]/g,'-') + '.mp4' }}",
        "driveId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "My Drive"
        },
        "folderId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "YOUR_DRIVE_FOLDER_ID"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "17000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000001a",
      "name": "Save to Google Drive",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleDrive",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        1780,
        640
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "googleDriveOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Google Drive account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "Results"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "title": "={{ $('Track Job').item.json.title }}",
            "drive_link": "={{ $json.webViewLink }}",
            "drive_file_id": "={{ $json.id }}"
          }
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "17000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000001b",
      "name": "Write Result to Sheet",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        2000,
        640
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Google Sheets account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "17000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000001c",
      "name": "All Rows Done",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        460,
        460
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Schedule": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Read Product Rows",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Read Product Rows": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Loop Over Rows",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Loop Over Rows": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "All Rows Done",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "node": "Build Export Body",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Build Export Body": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "POST /v1/export",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "POST /v1/export": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Track Job",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Track Job": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Wait",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Wait": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Get Export Job",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Get Export Job": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Export Done?",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Export Done?": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Download MP4",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "node": "Wait",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Download MP4": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Save to Google Drive",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Save to Google Drive": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Write Result to Sheet",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Write Result to Sheet": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Loop Over Rows",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "active": false,
  "settings": {},
  "pinData": {},
  "meta": {
    "templateCredsSetupCompleted": false
  }
}
